    "title": "North Miami-Dade Street Turns Chaotic as County Water Worker Gunned Down on the Job - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Elena Vega ,\n15 hours ago A routine day on the job turned violent Tuesday afternoon when a Miami-Dade Water and Sewer Department employee was shot and critically injured during an altercation in a North Miami-Dade neighborhood. The gunfire erupted just after 4:15 p.m. on March 17 at 444 NW 84th Street, and the worker was rushed to Jackson Memorial’s Ryder Trauma Center in critical condition. By Tuesday night, deputies were still at the scene, and no arrests had been announced. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
